               "latex": "f'(x) = 4\\left(x^{3} - 3x + 1\\right)^{3}\\left(3x^{2} - 3\\right)"
            },
            {
               "text": "Substitute x = 2, where the inner cubic equals 3.",
               "latex": "f'(2) = 4 \\cdot 3^{3} \\cdot 9 = 972"
            }
         ],
         "points": [
