         "answer_latex": "h'\\left(\\tfrac{\\pi}{18}\\right) = -\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2}",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Three layers: the square, the cosine, and 3x.",
               "latex": "h'(x) = 2\\cos(3x) \\cdot \\left(-\\sin(3x)\\right) \\cdot 3 = -6\\cos(3x)\\sin(3x)"
