            {
               "text": "The double angle identity gives a shorter form.",
               "latex": "h'(x) = -3\\sin(6x)"
            },
            {
               "text": "Substitute x = pi/18.",
               "latex": "h'\\left(\\tfrac{\\pi}{18}\\right) = -3\\sin\\left(\\tfrac{\\pi}{3}\\right) = -\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2}"
            }
